resources.string:
"1. Account-related information will be deleted and destroyed, and your friends will no longer be able to contact you; 

2. The remaining coins, diamonds and other data in the account will be cleared, and any profit losses will be borne by the initiator of account cancellation; 

3. Your real-name information will be unbound. After unbinding, you can bind other Hilla accounts again. 

4. The account cancellation function cannot be restored, please use it with caution!"
